{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.«tacticOn_goal_=&gt;_»\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">«tacticOn_goal_=&gt;_»</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`on_goal n => tacSeq` creates a block scope for the `n`-th goal and tries the sequence\nof tactics `tacSeq` on it.\n\n`on_goal -n => tacSeq` does the same, but the `n`-th goal is chosen by counting from the\nbottom.\n\n`on_goal n₁ ... nᵢ => tacSeq` runs `tacSeq` on each of the goals `n₁ ... nᵢ` separately.\n\nThe goal is not required to be solved and any resulting subgoals are inserted back into the\nlist of goals, replacing the chosen goal.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.«tacticOn_goal_=>_»","kind":"def","line":56,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.«tacticOn_goal_=>_»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.lean#L56-L78"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.tacticSwap\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">tacticSwap</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`swap` is a shortcut for `pick_goal 2`, which interchanges the 1st and 2nd goals. ","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.tacticSwap","kind":"def","line":54,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.tacticSwap","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.lean#L54-L54"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.tacticPick_goal_\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">tacticPick_goal_</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`pick_goal n` will move the `n`-th goal to the front.\n\n`pick_goal -n` will move the `n`-th goal (counting from the bottom) to the front.\n\nSee also `rotate_left`/`rotate_right`, which move goals from the front to the back and vice-versa.\n","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.tacticPick_goal_","kind":"def","line":41,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.tacticPick_goal_","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.lean#L41-L51"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.elabGoalNum\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabGoalNum</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goalNum</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Lean.Syntax</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.TacticM\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.TacticM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Turn the given `goalNum` syntax into a (zero-based) index in the current `getGoals` list. ","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.elabGoalNum","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.elabGoalNum","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.lean#L33-L39"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.goalNum\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">goalNum</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">Lean.ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A number referring to a goal in the tactic state. `n` refers to the `n`-th goal from the front,\nand `-n` refers to the `n`-th goal from the bottom. ","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.html#Batteries.Tactic.goalNum","kind":"def","line":29,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.goalNum","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/3a067208130fab4154e6a4dd29efd07e3a9466bd/Batteries/Tactic/PermuteGoals.lean#L29-L31"}}],"imports":["Init","Lean.Elab.Tactic.Basic","Lean.Exception"],"instances":[],"name":"Batteries.Tactic.PermuteGoals"}